cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RT-Mid: DAG Scheduling Middleware for Real-Time Subtask Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Middleware for real-time subtask pipelines organized as DAGs, with
  automatic subtask-to-core allocation (including a topology-based
  allocator, TDTA) as its main contribution.
